    "input": {
      "body": "Hi Ibrahim,\n\nMy earlier note focused on callbacks and client communication. This article looks at why adding AI doesn't automatically make either more reliable.\n\nThe technology can respond quickly, but the team still needs a clear owner for follow-up and a point where a lawyer takes over. That's shaping how we approach AI adoption at Possible Minds.\n\nhttps://getpossibleminds.com/t/8PWxqftDEg\n\nAt Accident Abe, would the bigger challenge be choosing the technology or defining how people work around it? I'd appreciate even a one-line take.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
      "subject": "Re: jelassi rahma submitted a Google review about Accident Abe",
